This project includes code from https://github.com/HazyResearch/ncm
(commit c702742, MIT license, Copyright (c) 2025 hermann kumbong),
located in vendor/ncm/. It is used as a reference implementation for
checkpoint loading and numerical parity tests, and is not part of the
runtime package.

NCM model checkpoints (hazyresearch/ncm-checkpoints) and datasets
(hazyresearch/ncm-datasets) are downloaded from the Hugging Face Hub
under their respective licenses.
